<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-FOURTH STAGE RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FOURTH STAGE RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
